      Application suites: the ported PolisOS Feature/Integration HTTP tests
      run against the real dummy consumer app (tests/Application) with the
      full Polis provider stack booted, via tests/bootstrap-app.php (no
      fixture-stub aliases) and a phpunit config separate from the Unit suite
      so the two worlds never collide.

      These suites enumerate ONLY the ported tests that genuinely pass today,
      exactly like the Unit suite in phpunit.xml. They are hard CI gates. As
      more ported tests are driven to green, add their files here (they
      currently live in the Consumer-Only suite in phpunit.xml). Do NOT add a
      test here until it passes, and do NOT force-pass failing tests.
    -->
